---
title: Checkout service architecture
---
flowchart LR
    customer([Customer])

    subgraph clients [Clients]
        web[Web app]
        mobile[Mobile app]
    end

    subgraph services [Services]
        gateway[API gateway]
        auth[Auth service]
        order[Order service]
        worker[Worker]
    end

    subgraph data [Data]
        db[(Orders database)]
        queue[[Queue]]
    end

    customer --> web
    customer --> mobile
    web -- HTTPS --> gateway
    mobile -- HTTPS --> gateway
    gateway -- validates tokens --> auth
    gateway -- requests --> order
    order -- reads / writes --> db
    order -- publishes --> queue
    queue -- consumed by --> worker
    worker -- updates --> db
